# Memory Bank

After every reset, rely on `memory-bank/` for project continuity. **Read all core files before non-trivial work:**

1. `memory-bank/projectbrief.md`
2. `memory-bank/productContext.md`
3. `memory-bank/systemPatterns.md`
4. `memory-bank/techContext.md`
5. `memory-bank/activeContext.md`
6. `memory-bank/progress.md`

Update Memory Bank when discovering new patterns, after significant changes, or when the user says **update memory bank** (especially `activeContext.md` and `progress.md`).

Do not invent a root `VERSION` file; version lives in `mobile/package.json` (see `docs/agents/versioning.md`).
